わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17769-17772">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17772-17784"><rb>果</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17784-17793">てて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17793-17817"><rb>狂氣</rb><rt>きやうき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17817-17820">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17820-17835"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17835-17841">く、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17841-17856"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17856-17868"><rb>家</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17868-17871">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17871-17892"><rb>音信</rb><rt>おとづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17892-17898">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17898-17910"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17910-17922">くと、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17922-17937"><rb>柳</rb><rt>りう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17937-17940">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17940-17958"><rb>丁</rb><rt>ちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17958-17961">ど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-17961-17985"><rb>爾時</rb><rt>そのとき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-17985-18006">……。あはれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18006-18027"><rb>草木</rb><rt>くさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18027-18033">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18033-18054"><rb>婦人</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18054-18060">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18060-18084"><rb>靈魂</rb><rt>たましひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18084-18087">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18087-18105"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18105-18123">があるのか。</seg></p>
